@title Yield (settled)
@keywords terminal, report, meters, threshold, revisit-truth
@audience adapter, G computation
@tone normative
@style pattern
@grade technique
@references [buffer-cleaner/kill]
@provenance v3 diagram terminal; SING meters only. Live evaluation: futon2 buffer-cleaner-adapter (receipts emit these fields).

! conclusion:
  The cycle ends with a typed report — meters, never prose claims.

  + METERS: remaining, kills-proposed, expected-recovery, fuel-charged.
  + CLEAN-ENOUGH-THRESHOLD: 16, :declared-for-worked-example-not-measured
    — the historical constructed 16 is never silently used as a real
    verdict.
  + REVISIT-TRUTH: :unavailable — no retained buffer-identity/kill/
    reopen history exists; unavailable, NOT false, never defaulted.
